WEBVTT

00:11:59.882 --> 00:12:02.426
about the shoes in which
we have never walked?

00:12:03.177 --> 00:12:04.720
It's hard being a woman,

00:12:04.762 --> 00:12:07.347
it's hard being a transgender woman.

00:12:07.389 --> 00:12:10.517
As a man, I just didn't know
what I didn't know.

00:12:11.059 --> 00:12:12.936
Would I do it all again?

00:12:12.936 --> 00:12:14.229
Of course I would.

00:12:14.855 --> 00:12:19.860
Because the call toward
authenticity is sacred, it's holy,

00:12:19.902 --> 00:12:21.779
it's for the greater good.

00:12:23.947 --> 00:12:27.367
For 45 years, my father
was a fundamentalist pastor.

00:12:28.619 --> 00:12:30.996
My mother is even more conservative.